<title>POLAND: Farm Food sets issue price at PLN 33.</title>
<headline>Farm Food sets issue price at PLN 33.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish meat processing firm Farm Food SA set the issue price of its 600,000 one-for-five rights issue at 33 zlotys per share, the firm said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It earlier said the funds from the issue were earmarked for equity investments in the meat industry.</p>
<p>The first period for taking over the rights will be held from January 2 to January 23 and the second period from February 13 to February 27 next year.</p>
<p>The issue will be available for shareholders of record as of December 23.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
